00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.940
Flip the switch!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.820
What are you waiting for? Hurry!

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.160
It's too dangerous to go get Chris back.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.540
The device is locked down.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:50.670
We can fiddle with the system, but then there's a chance that Chris won't be able to come home.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.880
Then what can we do?

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.420
Let's trust Chris.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.300
But...

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.260
Chris is no longer a child.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.180
He told us not to worry, so let's trust him. Okay?

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.270
I'm sure Chris will contact us if anything happens.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:16.440
We'll take turns keeping watch, and we'll contact you if something comes up.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:18.740
Thanks.

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:26.930
Episode 55

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:26.930
The Planet of Water, Hydo

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:43.300
Really? One of the Chaos Emeralds is nearby?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.810
There's no doubt about it.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.980
The Master Emerald in the engine room...

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.860
It was resonating to something!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.320
Are there any planets nearby?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.860
Umm...

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.540
Right there!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.370
What's the name of the planet?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.870
Planet Hydo.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:31.690
Okay!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.440
Blue Typhoon, head for Planet Hydo!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.820
Go!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.280
I'm the captain of the ship...

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.490
Don't sweat the details!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.150
I've confirmed that we can breathe in this atmosphere, so we can leave the ship.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.310
Umm...

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.360
On second thought...

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:19.940
Let's call this off.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.780
Why are you chickening out now?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.580
We're landing on water!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:57.600
It's different than the book! We must be in the wrong place!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.360
There's no mistake.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:03.150
The environment must have changed and transformed into a water planet.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.490
I can't believe it! No way!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.610
Sonic.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.540
I'll stick with you!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.710
So don't worry!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.330
Take off!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.150
I'm getting seasick...

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.110
Sonic really can't stand water.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.240
But don't worry. I'll take care of you.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.830
We're going to crash!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.290
Hey, give me a break!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.760
Is the Chaos Emerald really here?

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.550
There's no doubt about it.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.260
Because the Master Emerald is detecting it?

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.430
No, because of my intuition as a treasure hunter!

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.020
What?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.940
Shovel Claw!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:36.000
Dig, dig and dig some more!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.290
We should dig too.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.580
Yes.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:50.680
Dig, dig and dig some more.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.810
I'll search somewhere else.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.560
I wonder where Sonic and Chris are?

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.310
I wonder?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.690
I feel sick.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.450
I'm sorry.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.910
Where are we?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.160
It's an island!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.140
We're on land. You'll be fine now.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.310
Metarex!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.150
Does that mean Metarex already conquered this planet?

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:48.480
Yeah. The planet most likely filled with water when they stole its Planet Egg.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.240
I won't let them get away with this!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:01.460
Chris, run away!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.750
What are you talking about? Though I don't look like one, I'm a black belt!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.380
Black what?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.300
Tanaka taught me karate.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.890
Check out my skills! I can break five tiles in a single strike!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.930
All right!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.520
One more time!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.110
Quit playing around!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.950
I'm not playing around!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.780
Go and hide! Leave them to me!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.950
Why?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.540
"Why?"

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.170
You are who you are, Chris.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.960
Sonic still treats me like a child.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:52.380
My skills are only off because my body shrunk.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.470
But since I now know that that's the cause...

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.930
Got 'em!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.650
Ouch!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.440
Chris!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.750
Run for it!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:25.370
I'm fine.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.500
You're not fine!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.040
Sonic!

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:46.640
Sonic!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.660
Sonic!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.540
Sonic, I'll rescue you right away!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.670
Don't worry about me! Just get out of here!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.340
But...

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.840
If you're also caught, who's going to get help?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.480
Okay.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.320
But I promise I'll come back and rescue you!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.950
Sonic was captured?

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:56.460
Yeah, so I'm going to go rescue him right away.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.330
Rescue him? Do you know where he is?

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:02.170
No, but I'm sure I'll figure it out along the way!

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:03.800
You won't!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:04.840
But...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.300
Calm down, Chris.

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:10.180
How can I be calm at a time like this?

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.680
I'm sorry.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:18.310
Let's first gather information and find Sonic.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.360
You're right.

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:23.980
This is Blue Typhoon.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:27.280
This is Amy. I'm currently underground on the island.

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.700
There's bad news about Sonic, Amy.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.240
He was captured, right?

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:33.120
How did you know?

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.500
The people on this planet told me.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.330
That's why I decided to contact you immediately.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.960
I'm sorry! It's all my fault!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:44.590
Don't worry about it, Chris. This needs to happen to him every now and then to serve as a lesson.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:49.130
Besides, this will be a great chance to show Sonic my love!

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:51.140
"I've come to save you, Sonic."

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.390
"Thank you, Amy."

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.970
"Oh, come on. We're friends, aren't we?"

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:58.690
"But I have to thank you by giving something in return. Amy, close your eyes."

00:11:58.690 --> 00:11:59.650
"Like this?"

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.150
"Amy, I love you."

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:04.690
"Oh my, Sonic!"

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:05.730
Hey, Amy.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:06.820
What is it, Sonic?

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:10.530
No, I'm Chris. Can I do anything to help?

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:13.700
No. And stay out of this! I won't forgive you if you get in my way!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:14.990
Okay.

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:21.040
Tails, after I rescue Sonic, pick us up in the X-Tornado.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:21.960
Roger.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:24.960
Tails, are you sure there's nothing for me to do?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.170
Nothing in particular...

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.390
Why don't you take a shower?

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:52.200
What have I been doing for the past six years?

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:55.200
I entered college.

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:59.250
I learned karate from Tanaka and became a little stronger.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:04.750
I studied under Grandpa and acquired licenses for all types of vehicles.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.840
Mom and Dad cried when I started working part-time, but I experienced new things.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.800
I thought I matured, but...

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.220
You are who you are, Chris.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:21.810
Does Sonic and the others think that I haven't changed at all?

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.110
Probably.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:30.360
I don't have incredible powers like Sonic.

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:36.120
I can't fight like them.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:45.130
I'm not even as strong as Cream and Cheese.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:51.800
Why did I come to this world?

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.190
Sonic...

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:15.200
I sensed that Sonic was in danger.

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:18.030
That's why I needed to come and rescue him.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.740
What's that blueprint for?

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.250
Umm...

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.290
Can I see it?

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.800
What's this?

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.090
It's a magnet barrier.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.930
It extracts ring energy from space.

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:40.100
And this?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:46.520
They're speed shoes. The soles are made of a special resin that increases the friction with the ground-

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.020
Don't laugh!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.400
Sonic would enjoy it.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:53.780
Do you think so?

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:55.200
Yes.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.620
This is no time to brood!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.040
I'm not a kid anymore! I have to do whatever I can!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.510
That's the place?

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:21.510
Yes.

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.770
Thanks for bringing me here.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:27.390
Please be careful. They're not made of flesh and blood.

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:28.980
Because they're machines.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.950
C'mon, chill out!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:53.090
If my spikes get caught in your throat, it's going to hurt.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:54.880
Sonic!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:29.210
Move X-Tornado to the catapult!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.030
Set the catapult!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.710
Launching X-Tornado!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.650
Sonic!

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:48.870
Why did you do that for?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.620
Just a reflex.

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:52.040
Look out behind you!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:59.210
Sonic is mine!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.130
Amy!

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:20.610
This is bad!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:21.820
Amy!

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.620
Let's return to Typhoon for now.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.490
Yeah.

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:33.460
But first, do something about this!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:42.380
You missed!

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:43.510
Oh no!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.470
Oh no!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.890
That's why I said to do something about this first!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.610
Sonic!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.610
Chris!

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.270
Use this!

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.200
Sonic...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.630
He's hovering! How?

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.720
It's all thanks to Chris.

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:31.180
They're Hovercraft Shoes! That's an incredible invention, Chris!

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.260
Thanks.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:34.220
The Metarex are coming!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:39.980
How dare you feed me to your fish!

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:04.170
Here I go!

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.740
Chris, thanks!

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:37.080
What's that?

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.260
It's Planet Egg!

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.450
The water is receding!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.080
The planet will turn back to normal.

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:31.130
I shouldn't be sleeping!

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:47.900
Is it a seashell? Let's check it out!

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:49.740
Wait for me!

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:03.040
It feels great to touch the earth!

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:07.420
Thank you, Chris!

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:09.380
You're a lifesaver!

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:15.340
I'll make more if you like them. Is that okay?

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:17.600
Of course!

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:21.020
I'm going for a run.

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:54.310
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:54.310
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:54.310
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

